# `KEYWORD-RENAME-SCOPE`: the flowchart connector rename is GATED BY THE DECLARED
# LANGUAGE VERSION. `GENRE-CONNECTOR-SPELLING` applied it to `figdown 0.1` and that BROKE documents
# that were legal at v0.1.8 — this exact file stopped parsing. Under core §13.0
# only a MAJOR version removes, so `edge` stays legal here until v1.0.
figdown 0.1 flowchart
process a "Step"
decision q "Ok?"
edge a -> q
edge q -[yes]-> a
